<rml>
<head>
	<title>Victory epilogue (Phase 7 wireframe)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="../../components.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="phase7.rcss"/>
</head>
<!-- M2 wireframe (docs/ui/intro.md, docs/ui/epilogue.md). Literal data.
     Generated by tools/ui/phase7_mocks.py: edit the generator, not this file. -->
<body class="ep">
<div class="ep-bg"></div>
<div class="ep-root">
<div class="ep-col">
	<div class="ep-head">
		<span class="ep-kicker" id="epilogue.title">Arulco is free</span>
		<span class="ep-sub" id="epilogue.sub">Deidranna is dead. The war is over.</span>
	</div>
	<p class="ep-text" id="epilogue.text">The occupation is over. What becomes of Arulco now is not decided by a
	bullet, but by the people who stayed when the world looked away.</p>
	<div class="ep-stats">
		<div class="ep-stat"><span class="ep-num">18</span><span class="ep-label">days in arulco</span></div>
		<div class="ep-stat"><span class="ep-num">41</span><span class="ep-label">sectors liberated</span><span class="ep-sub">of 256</span></div>
		<div class="ep-stat"><span class="ep-num">612</span><span class="ep-label">enemies killed</span><span class="ep-sub">21 admins · 402 troops · 189 elites</span></div>
		<div class="ep-stat"><span class="ep-num">9</span><span class="ep-label">mercs who served</span><span class="ep-sub">of them 2 fell</span></div>
	</div>
	<div class="ep-effort" id="epilogue.effort">
		<span class="ep-label">war effort</span>
		<div class="bar thick"><div class="fill" style="width: 78%"></div></div>
		<span class="ep-pct">78%</span>
	</div>
	<div class="ep-row">
		<div class="ep-row-head">Those who came home</div>
		<div class="ep-chips"><div class="ep-chip" id="epilogue.chip.0" title="Fox"><span class="ep-face"><img src="face-0"/></span><span class="ep-name">Fox</span></div>
		<div class="ep-chip" id="epilogue.chip.2" title="Len"><span class="ep-face"><img src="face-2"/></span><span class="ep-name">Len</span></div>
		<div class="ep-chip" id="epilogue.chip.5" title="Ivan"><span class="ep-face"><img src="face-5"/></span><span class="ep-name">Ivan</span></div>
		<div class="ep-chip" id="epilogue.chip.11" title="Barry"><span class="ep-face"><img src="face-11"/></span><span class="ep-name">Barry</span></div>
		<div class="ep-chip" id="epilogue.chip.22" title="Livewire"><span class="ep-face"><img src="face-22"/></span><span class="ep-name">Livewire</span></div>
		<div class="ep-chip" id="epilogue.chip.38" title="Meltdown"><span class="ep-face"><img src="face-38"/></span><span class="ep-name">Meltdown</span></div></div>
	</div>
	<div class="ep-row">
		<div class="ep-row-head">The fallen</div>
		<div class="ep-chips"><div class="ep-chip dead" id="epilogue.chip.4" title="Trevor, fallen"><span class="ep-face"><img src="face-4"/></span><span class="ep-name">Trevor</span><img class="icon sm" src="icon-dead"/><span class="ep-badge">fallen</span></div>
		<div class="ep-chip dead" id="epilogue.chip.17" title="Kyle, fallen"><span class="ep-face"><img src="face-17"/></span><span class="ep-name">Kyle</span><img class="icon sm" src="icon-dead"/><span class="ep-badge">fallen</span></div></div>
	</div>
	<div class="ep-actions">
		<button class="btn btn-primary" id="epilogue.continue"><span class="label">Continue to credits</span><span class="kbd">Enter</span></button>
		<button class="btn btn-ghost" id="epilogue.menu"><span class="label">Main menu</span><span class="kbd">Esc</span></button>
	</div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</rml>
